  "body": "Devon Park is renowned for its secure, beautifully maintained environment, which includes a large solar heated swimming pool. Surrounded by mature trees and landscaped grounds, the complex occupies a commanding position overlooking the harbour and Auckland city skyline.\r\nIf you are considering downsizing and leaving maintenance and lawns behind you, this opportunity is definitely worth your consideration. Positioned to capture breath-taking, ever-changing views across the Waitemata Harbour, this is a home you'll never tire of coming back to. \r\nThe apartment features two double bedrooms, two bathrooms, and a modern galley style kitchen, all designed for easy, low maintenance living. Recently upgraded joinery adds a fresh contemporary feel, complementing the ongoing enhancements throughout the complex.\r\nWith regular public transport links from Stanley Point Road to Devonport Village, the ferry terminal, and the CBD beyond, convenience is well and truly covered.\r\nA superb lifestyle opportunity for buyers at any stage of their property journey. Inspection is highly recommended. \r\nCall for an appointment to view. \r\n\r\nIf you would like any further information on Devon Park please visit: https://www.devonparkauckland.co.nz\r\n\r\nTo download property files please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/GURV",
